# Copy this file to .env.local (already gitignored) and fill in your own values.
# Never commit real keys/secrets — .env.local is for your machine only.

# Dropbox app key for the "Import from Dropbox" button (Chooser file picker).
# 1. Create an app at https://www.dropbox.com/developers/apps ("Scoped access",
#    any access type works since the Chooser widget doesn't use API scopes).
# 2. In the app's settings, under "Chooser/Saver/Embedder domains", add the
#    domain(s) you'll run this app from (e.g. localhost for `npm run dev`,
#    and your production domain once deployed). Chooser requires http(s) -
#    it won't work when dist/index.html is opened directly via file://.
# 3. Copy the app key shown on the app's settings page here.
# Leave unset to hide the "Import from Dropbox" button entirely.
VITE_DROPBOX_APP_KEY=
